"                   of a normal distributed random variable with mean mean "
"and standard\n"
"                   deviation sigma. A return value of 1 indicates, that the "
"null\n"
"                   hypothesis is rejected, i.e. the sample is not a random "
"sample of\n"
"                   the normal distribution.\n"
